        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (100–120 words).** Write about a song that matters to you: what it says and what it reminds you of.\n\n**Speak (about 2 minutes).** Talk aloud about the music you listen to, a concert you remember and an instrument you would like to play."
